<title>JAPAN: Promise down on ATM lending restrictions.</title>
<headline>Promise down on ATM lending restrictions.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Promise Co Ltd fell on Tuesday morning due to news that the consumer financing firm would restrict the time when customers could borrow money via its automated terminals, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0152 GMT, the shares were down 30 yen at 5,710 yen.</p>
